  "prefLabel": "Plc 1502.11 Indirect supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1502.11 “Indirect supervision” means supervision through the supervisor’s review of the treatment progress notes made by the individual being supervised, telephone conversations between the supervisor and the individual being supervised, electronic correspondence between the supervisor and the individual being supervised, or any other form of supervision that is not direct supervision.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1502.10) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
